    "c": "<strong>Solution:</strong><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$z = 1 + \\sqrt{3}i = (1,\\ \\sqrt{3})$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$r = \\sqrt{1 + 3} = 2$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$\\cos\\theta = \\frac{1}{2},\\quad \\sin\\theta = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$\\theta = \\frac{\\pi}{3}$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$z = 2\\left(\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{3} + i\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$z^4 = 16\\left(\\cos\\frac{4\\pi}{3} + i\\sin\\frac{4\\pi}{3}\\right)$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$z^4 = 16\\left(-\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}i\\right) = -8 - 8\\sqrt{3}i$</div><br><br><strong>Final Answer: $-8 - 8\\sqrt{3}i$</strong>"
  },
