  {
    "type": "math_show",
    "q": "Find the complex number $z$ such that $iz + 2\\bar{z} = 5 + 4i$.",
    "c": "<strong>Solution:</strong><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>Let $z = x + yi$, then $\\bar{z} = x - yi$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$i(x + yi) + 2(x - yi) = 5 + 4i$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$ix + yi^2 + 2x - 2yi = 5 + 4i$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$(2x - y) + (x - 2y)i = 5 + 4i$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$2x - y = 5$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$x - 2y = 4$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$x = 4 + 2y$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$2(4 + 2y) - y = 5 \\implies 8 + 3y = 5 \\implies y = -1$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$x = 4 - 2 = 2$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$z = 2 - i$</div><br><br><strong>Final Answer: $2 - i$</strong>"
