nchor='end'>4</text><line x1='305.0' y1='194' x2='305.0' y2='206' stroke='#FFFFFF' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='194' y1='95.0' x2='206' y2='95.0' stroke='#FFFFFF' stroke-width='2'/><text x='305.0' y='224' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='13' text-anchor='middle'>6</text><text x='188' y='100.0' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='13' text-anchor='end'>6</text><line x1='340.0' y1='194' x2='340.0' y2='206' stroke='#FFFFFF' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='194' y1='60.0' x2='206' y2='60.0' stroke='#FFFFFF' stroke-width='2'/><text x='340.0' y='224' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='13' text-anchor='middle'>8</text><text x='188' y='65.0' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='13' text-anchor='end'>8</text><line x1='200.0' y1='305.0' x2='200.0' y2='200' stroke='#00EEFF' stroke-width='2' stroke-dasharray='6 4' opacity='0.75'/><line x1='200.0' y1='305.0' x2='200' y2='305.0' stroke='#00EEFF' stroke-width='2' stroke-dasharray='6 4' opacity='0.75'/><line x1='200' y1='200' x2='200.0' y2='305.0' stroke='#00EEFF' stroke-width='4'/><circle cx='200.0' cy='305.0' r='7' fill='#00EEFF'/><text x='338' y='188' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='16'>Re</text><text x='210' y='52' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='16'>Im</text><text x='210' y='224' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='16'>O</text><text x='214.0' y='291.0' fill='#00EEFF' font-size='18' font-weight='700'>z</text></svg></div>",
    "c": "<strong>Solution:</strong><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$z = -6i = (0,\\ -6)$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$r = 6$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$\\cos\\theta = 0,\\quad \\sin\\theta = -1$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$\\theta = -\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\quad (\\text{not }\\frac{3\\pi}{2})$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$z = 6\\left(\\cos\\left(-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right) + i\\sin\\left(-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)\\right)$</div><br><br><strong>Final Answer: $6\\left[\\cos\\left(-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right) + i\\sin\\left(-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)\\right]$</strong>"
  },
  {
    "type": "math_show",
    "q": "Write down the trigonometric form of $z = \\sqrt{2} + \\sqrt{6}i$ with $-\\pi < \\theta \\le \\pi$.",
    "c": "<strong>Solution:</strong><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$z = \\sqrt{2} + \\sqrt{6}i$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$r = \\sqrt{2 + 6} = 2\\sqrt{2}$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$\\cos\\theta = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2\\sqrt{2}} = \\frac{1}{2}$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$\\sin\\theta = \\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{2\\sqrt{2}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$\\theta = \\frac{\\pi}{3}$</div><br><br><div style='overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;'>$z = 2\\sqrt{2}\\left(\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{3} + i\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)$</div><br><br><strong>Final Answer: $2\\sqrt{2}\\left[\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{3} + i\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right]$</strong>"
  },
